__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store

# dbt writes these into any project it runs against, including the fixtures and
# scenario inputs used for testing. Committing them would let a downloaded package
# masquerade as a team's own code, which is precisely what the convention
# inference is built to ignore.
#
# Some scenarios do commit a fake vendored package on purpose, to prove the
# inference excludes it. Those files are already tracked and so are unaffected;
# a new one needs `git add -f`.
**/dbt_packages/
**/logs/
**/package-lock.yml
**/.user.yml

# Per-repository VS Code and Antigravity installs are generated from the
# canonical plugin source. Keep accidental self-installs out of this source repo.
/.github/ae-toolkit/
/.github/agents/
/.github/hooks/
/.github/prompts/
/.github/skills/
/.vscode/
/.agents/
/AGENTS.md
